      detail: `Commands: ./deploy/Invoke-NpiDeploySmokeTest.ps1 -SettingsPath tests/fixtures/deploy/settings.test.json -Stage test -RegisterRun tests/fixtures/deploy/register-run -ExpectCaState ReportOnly -FixturePath tests/fixtures/deploy/tenant-test.json -OutputPath out/dryrun/test-smoke; ./deploy/Invoke-NpiDeployRollback.ps1 -Mode Plan -SettingsPath tests/fixtures/deploy/settings.test.json -Stage test -SnapshotPath out/dryrun/test-preflight/snapshot.json -To Disabled -IncludeSmokeCleanup -FixturePath tests/fixtures/deploy/tenant-test.json -OutputPath out/dryrun/test-rollback; $sha = (Get-FileHash out/dryrun/test-rollback/rollback-plan.json -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToLower(); ./deploy/Invoke-NpiDeployRollback.ps1 -Mode Apply ... -PlanPath out/dryrun/test-rollback/rollback-plan.json -ApprovedSha256 $sha -FixturePath tests/fixtures/deploy/tenant-test.json -OutputPath out/dryrun/test-rollback-dry. Smoke test, 8 Pass: ST-01 (OwnerCount 2, Secrets 0, CredentialKind Federated); ST-02 (Risk HIGH: password never expires); ST-03 (refused: Graph returned 400 (BadRequest): (fixture) Refused by the app management policy (real code unverified)); ST-04 (1 credential, 1 exact match); ST-05 twice (CA015 and CA037: state enabledForReportingButNotEnforced; assigned directly: True); ST-06 (2 sign-ins since 2026-11-01T12:00:00Z; results: reportOnlyFailure, reportOnlyNotApplied); ST-07 (Test-ADServiceAccount True; svc-npi-smoke enabled True); Evidence: SMOKE-smoke-test.json (Pass). Rollback plan, 7 actions: RB-01 and RB-02 ConditionalAccessState for CA015 and CA037; RB-03 TenantAppPolicyRestore defaultAppManagementPolicy; RB-04 AppPolicyOff npi-pilot-block-secrets; RB-05 AdEnable svc-payexport; RB-06 Cleanup SpDisable synthetic service principal; RB-07 Cleanup AdDisable svc-npi-smoke. Plan SHA-256 for the reviewer: 00105622acf1165bd55d606ea781b908d700f79f9f82cba5e67bd4f0d3081b81. Rollback DryRun, 7 WouldApply, both workload policies enabledForReportingButNotEnforced -> disabled; Evidence: ROLLBACK-rollback.json (DryRun). The fixture's error for the refused probe is invented: Learn doesn't give the exact error code an app management policy returns (research gaps, row 101).`,
