      say: `Production's preflight runs against a fictional production tenant, with the test stage's smoke test as its evidence. Fourteen passes. The Conditional Access administrator is now eligible through PIM, and check eleven, production only, says the test smoke test passed eight of eight in another tenant. Then the evidence check on the test stage says no-go, and that's right for a dry run. Steps 1.1 to 1.5 record their evidence only against a real tenant, and a dry-run rollback records dry run, which the go/no-go doesn't accept. A rollback applied with the wrong hash sends nothing. And the deploy tests: sixty pass.`,
      detail: `Commands: ./deploy/Test-NpiDeployPreflight.ps1 -SettingsPath tests/fixtures/deploy/settings.production.json -Stage production -BaselinePath tests/fixtures/deploy/vk-baseline.json -PromotionEvidencePath out/dryrun/test-smoke -FixturePath tests/fixtures/deploy/tenant-production.json -OutputPath out/dryrun/prod-preflight -EvidencePath out/dryrun/evidence-production; ./deploy/Test-NpiDeployEvidence.ps1 -SettingsPath tests/fixtures/deploy/settings.test.json -Stage test -EvidencePath out/dryrun/evidence. Production preflight, 14 Pass: as in test, with npi-smoke-production, app-prd-01.corp.contoso.example, the Conditional Access administrator eligible, and PF-11 Pass: test, tenant c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-0000000000e1, 8/8 Pass. Evidence for the test stage (CHG-2026-1102-T): 4 of 9 rows present and passing: PRE Present Warn (KSI-CMT-LMC, KSI-CMT-VTD, KSI-IAM-ELP, KSI-IAM-JIT, KSI-IAM-SNU, KSI-MLA-EVC, KSI-MLA-LET, KSI-PIY-GIV); S0 Present Pass; S1.1, S1.2, S1.3, S1.5 Missing (Chapter 01's and 02's run folders; Chapter 04's policy plan or apply; Chapter 05's plan and apply; Chapter 08's plan and apply); SMOKE Present Pass; ROLLBACK Failing DryRun; EVIDENCE Present Pass; Result: NO-GO on evidence (exit code 1). The NO-GO is right for a dry run: Steps 1.1 to 1.5 record their own evidence when they run against a tenant, and a dry-run rollback records DryRun, which the go/no-go doesn't accept. The smoke test's record begins with schema fmp-npi-deploy-evidence/1, step SMOKE, recordedAt, environment test, cloud gcc, the tenant, the change record, settingsSha256, mode Fixture, the command, result Pass, the controls (AC-2, AC-3, AC-6, AU-12, AU-2, CA-7, CM-8, IA-4, IA-5, IA-9), other (OMB M-22-09 §III.A, SCuBA MS.AAD.5.5v1 SHOULD) and the KSIs; SHA256SUMS lists every file in the folder. An approved hash other than the plan's stops the rollback before it sends anything: The plan's SHA-256 is 00105622…, not the approved 0000…. Nothing was sent. deploy/tests/NpiDeploy.Tests.ps1 has 60 tests; all 60 passed in the same scratch copy on November 21, 2026. Delete the dry run's folder when done: Remove-Item -Recurse -Force out/dryrun.`,
